# The GitHub social preview is one small PNG that every clone should receive as a
# real file (GitHub serves it as the OG image for link shares), so it is
# deliberately opted out of Git LFS. Keep it under 1 MiB.
assets/social-preview.png -filter -diff -merge -text

# Brand assets are tiny and must be readable by mkdocs and GitHub without a
# Git LFS client, so they are opted out of LFS.
docs/assets/* -filter -diff -merge -text
